A comment run after a glued attribute keeps its written column

```
-{.g} {% b
   b %}
.
<ul>
  <li class="g">{% b
b %}</li>
</ul>
```

```
> 1.{#i} {% b
>    b %}
.
<blockquote>
  <ol>
    <li id="i">{% b
b %}</li>
  </ol>
</blockquote>
```

```
-{.g} {% b
       b %}
.
<ul>
  <li class="g"></li>
</ul>
```
